Layer 1 — The Cockpit (Open Source)

This license covers the open-source "cockpit" layer of the OSINT Sentinel
Workstation: the Electron shell, Cesium globe integration, plugin manager,
UI panels, draw tools, basic plugins, analyst engine, world overlay, HUD,
live feed wiring, routing UI, hydrology UI, AI console, and documentation.

